<title>UK: First USA CCMT sets $545 mln two-tranche FRN.</title>
<headline>First USA CCMT sets $545 mln two-tranche FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset-backed</p>
<p>two-tranche FRN was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST USA CREDIT CARD MASTR TRUST 1997-2</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 1M-LIBOR  LEG MAT     17.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+13 AREA  EXP MAT     17.MAY.04</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	PAY FREQ   MONTHLY   PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	  AAA	 ISSUE PRICE *</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT    $45.18 MLN    BASE	 1M-LIBOR  LEG MAT     17.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+33 AREA  EXP MAT     17.MAY.04</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	PAY FREQ   MONTHLY   PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  S&amp;P	  A	   ISSUE PRICE *</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  USA	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
